Answer:

Different professionals have different responsibilities in a web development project.

1. Frontend Developer

A frontend developer creates the user interface and client-side functionality.

Responsibilities:
Create webpage layouts
Write HTML, CSS, and JavaScript
Create responsive designs
Implement buttons, forms, menus, etc.

Example:
Creating the login page that contains:

Username
Password

